{"id":"6669b410785fb609e5e25e6e3603b76c01465cb8","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1246758","title":"关于 Claude 封号猜想","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"ylual","excerpt":"Claude - @ylual - 我用的是公司的应该是属于 Team 或 Enterprise 套餐，即每个人用自己的工作账号（应该是 Google workspace ）登录使用。有过比较多的危险操作，比如换 VPN 、VP","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/ylual\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/27cb2a68c5ceaf8bb1c38221eb8b370a?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"ylual\" data-uid=\"379294\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/ylual\">ylual</a> · <span title=\"2026-10-07 13:16:51 +08:00\">6h 45m ago</span> · 1144 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>我用的是公司的应该是属于 Team 或 Enterprise 套餐，即每个人用自己的工作账号（应该是 Google workspace ）登录使用。</p>\n<p>有过比较多的危险操作，比如换 VPN 、VPN 掉线后 Claude Code 提示地区不支持等，但是都一直没有被封号，所以猜想是不是 Team/Enterprise 套餐比较不容易封号？</p>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/封号\"><li></li> 封号</a><a href=\"/tag/套餐\"><li></li> 套餐</a><a href=\"/tag/账号\"><li></li> 账号</a></P><p><span>9 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-10-07 18:26:49 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18151610\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/27cb2a68c5ceaf8bb1c38221eb8b370a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ylual\" data-uid=\"379294\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ylual\">ylual</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-07 13:19:56 +08:00\">6h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/413420\">413420</a> But ，真的，没被封过，而且其他同事估计也是各种危险操作，也没说被封</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n